    {
      "date": "1976-11-04",
      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "The City Planning Commission unanimously returned the lot to RH-2 on its proposed zoning map (Resolution 7596) and let the boys' home grow from six residents to nine, for one year only, over neighbours' objections (Resolution 7597).",
